WEBVTT

00:12:29.958 --> 00:12:32.309
AG: When he graduated,
Jason got a management role

00:12:32.333 --> 00:12:34.768
with the Pittsburgh Penguins
hockey franchise.

00:12:34.792 --> 00:12:37.893
His job was to supervise
contract negotiations,

00:12:37.917 --> 00:12:40.476
and he kept right on steamrolling.

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:44.184
JB: I wanted to prove
to the people I worked with

00:12:44.208 --> 00:12:46.934
that I was ready to handle
the responsibilities in a job.

00:12:46.958 --> 00:12:51.643
I wanted to prove to people
and agents within the industry

00:12:51.667 --> 00:12:54.268
that I was gonna be tough enough
and aggressive enough

00:12:54.292 --> 00:12:55.684
to be able to handle myself.

00:12:55.708 --> 00:12:58.018
AG: What were some of
the more aggressive things

00:12:58.042 --> 00:13:00.143
that you would say to
kick off a negotiation